WEBVTT

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:32.023
upon realizing that the cows in the fields

00:02:32.064 --> 00:02:35.693
and the cows on my dad's grill
were the same cows ...

00:02:35.735 --> 00:02:38.112
(Laughter)

00:02:38.112 --> 00:02:41.908
I asked my parents
if I could go vegetarian.

00:02:41.949 --> 00:02:44.035
To which they said,

00:02:44.035 --> 00:02:47.788
"Sure, but let's wait
until you're done growing first."

00:02:48.247 --> 00:02:53.711
So sure that I would change my mind
over the next five to nine years.

00:02:54.837 --> 00:02:56.255
Well.

00:02:56.797 --> 00:02:58.925
Shortly after my 12th birthday,

00:02:58.966 --> 00:03:02.011
I took the plunge,
and I gave up meat completely.